{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/udsvah03","slide":9,"text":"【只记一句】ERP 场景更看重可控执行，而不是代码看起来更少。\n\n【可直接照读】LangChain适合简单调用，LangGraph适合有状态和人工确认的流程，Deep Agents适合开放长任务。审批和日报需要暂停、恢复和安全写入，因此 LangGraph 更贴合主流程。\n\n【时间建议】约 35 秒\n\n[Sources]\n- D:/PythonProject/LearnOne/ai_approval_assistant/app/graph/workflow.py\n- D:/PythonProject/LearnOne/ai_deep_agents_assistant/app/agents/approval_agent.py\n- C:/Users/EDY/Pictures/5.jpg\n- C:/Users/EDY/Pictures/7.jpg\n[/Sources]"}